        "description": "Sion fires a short range shockwave that damages and slows and reduces the Armor of the first enemy hit. If the shockwave hits a minion or monster, it will be knocked back, damaging, slowing, and reducing the Armor of all enemies that it passes through.",
        "tooltip": "Sion fires a shockwave, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(65/100/135/170/205 + (55% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> them by 40/45/50/55/60% for 2.5 seconds and removing <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">25% Armor</span> for 4 seconds. Non-champions hit are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked Back</span>. Enemies hit by a <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked Back</span> unit take the same damage and effects.",
